{"step_index":1419,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-21T17:06:08Z","input_tokens":2521,"cache_read_tokens":221372,"output_tokens":1266,"thinking":"The simulation completed all 601 steps successfully. The final wavefunction and charge density data, saved at the end of step 600, were located and their sizes noted. These files were from the simulation's conclusion on November 21st at 11:22.\n\n\nThe existing data confirms a successful simulation run. Now, a synchronization script is needed to back up the simulation results to the network attached storage (NAS). The script must perform an overwrite copy of the local directory to the specified NAS location.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\nr\"\"\"\nsync_bulk_900steps_to_nas_bulk2.py\n==============================================================================\n【ユーザー特例承認済み】\nNAS (\\\\192.168.12.69\\Results\\yamazaki\\research\\第一原理分子動力学法\\{101_0}8周期3.0Å構造最適化なしtest run\\バルクモデル2) に、\n8周期バルクモデルの 300 K NVT-AIMD (Step 600 から完全引き継ぎ・追加 300 steps -> 通算 900 steps)\nの全データを上書き同期・保存するスクリプト\n==============================================================================\n\"\"\"\nimport subprocess\nimport base64\n\nps_script = r\"\"\"\n$ErrorActionPreference = \"Continue\"\n$nasRoot = \"\\\\192.168.12.69\\Results\\yamazaki\\research\"\n$aimdRoot = Join-Path $nasRoot \"第一原理分子動力学法\"\n$parentDir = Join-Path $aimdRoot \"{101_0}8周期3.0Å構造最適化なしtest run\"\n$targetDir = Join-Path $parentDir \"バルクモデル2\"\n\nNew-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path $aimdRoot | Out-Null\nNew-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path $parentDir | Out-Null\nNew-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path $targetDir | Out-Null\n\n$wslRoot = \"\\\\wsl.localhost\\Ubuntu\\home\\WORKSTATION4WSL\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\mdi_workspace_backup\"\n$bulk900Wsl = Join-Path $wslRoot \"aimd_2H-SiC_10-10_8periods_bulk_300K_900steps_rtx5080\"\n\nif (Test-Path -LiteralPath (Join-Path $wslRoot \"run_8periods_bulk_aimd_continue_to_900steps.py\")) {\n    Copy-Item -LiteralPath (Join-Path $wslRoot \"run_8periods_bulk_aimd_continue_to_900steps.py\") -Destination $targetDir -Force\n}\n\nif (Test-Path -LiteralPath $bulk900Wsl) {\n    Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $bulk900Wsl -File | ForEach-Object {\n        if ($_.Name -ne \"prev_600steps_espresso_all_steps.pwo\") {\n            try {\n                Copy-Item -LiteralPath $_.FullName -Destination $targetDir -Force -ErrorAction Stop\n            } catch {\n                Write-Host \"Skipped locked/busy file:\" $_.Name\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nWrite-Host \"=== Target NAS Directory: $targetDir ===\"\nGet-ChildItem -LiteralPath $targetDir | Select-Object Name, Length\n\"\"\"\n\nenc = base64.b64encode(ps_script.encode(\"utf-16le\")).decode(\"ascii\")\nres = subprocess.run(\n    [\"/mnt/c/Windows/System32/WindowsPowerShell/v1.0/powershell.exe\", \"-NoProfile\", \"-EncodedCommand\", enc],\n    capture_output=True,\n    timeout=180,\n)\nprint(res.stdout.decode(\"cp932\", errors=\"replace\"))\nif res.stderr:\n    print(\"STDERR:\", res.stderr.decode(\"cp932\", errors=\"replace\"))\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_workspace_backup/sync_bulk_900steps_to_nas_bulk2.py"}}]}
{"step_index":1420,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-21T17:06:25Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-22T02:06:25+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-22T02:06:29+09:00\nCreated At: 2026-11-22T02:06:25+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-22T02:06:29+09:00\nCreated file."}
{"step_index":1421,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-21T17:06:29Z","input_tokens":3395,"cache_read_tokens":221844,"output_tokens":16071,"thinking":"Initial conditions are established by inheriting all states through Step 600. The simulation will continue for an additional 300 steps (601-900). This involves propagating the system's position, velocity, Nosé-Hoover thermostat variables, converged wavefunctions, electron density, energy, and atomic forces through this new timeframe.\n\n\nA new script is being developed to extend the simulation to 900 steps. Key files and settings from the 600-step simulation are copied and adapted. This includes transferring the previous simulation's output file containing the wavefunction and electron density data to initialize the extended run.\n\n\nThe simulation is extended to 900 steps by copying the final state from the 600-step run, including wavefunctions, electron density, and PAW states. The existing `qe_mdi_engine_rtx5080.py` script will load the 600-step data, replay the simulation up to the checkpoint at step 600, and ensure consistency. Subsequently, the GPU SCF will execute from step 601 to 900 using the transferred wavefunctions and electron density.\n\n\nSimulation results will be summarized and statistics generated for different time segments (0-300, 300-600, 600-900, 400-900, 500-900).  These outputs will include ensemble statistics and various energy and temperature graphs formatted according to specified dimensions and resolution for use in presentations. Additionally, existing files in a designated \"bulk model\" directory will be updated with the new 900-step data, replacing the previous 600-step results.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\nr\"\"\"\nrun_8periods_bulk_aimd_continue_to_900steps.py\n==============================================================================\n2H-SiC {10-10} 8周期相当 (16層, 288原子) 真のバルクモデル (真空層 0 Å)\nStep 600 終了時点の全データ (位置座標、速度、Nosé-Hoover熱浴内部状態、収束済み波動関数、電子密度、エネルギー・原子力)\nを 100% 完全引き継ぎし、追加 300 ステップ (Step 601 ～ 900, 通算 900 steps = 900 fs = 0.9 ps) を実行するスクリプト。\n\n・引き継ぎ機構 (AGENTS.md §12 完全準拠):\n  1. Step 0 ～ 600: 前回完了した `espresso_all_steps.pwo` から全 601 ステップの DFT エネルギーと\n     Hellmann-Feynman 力を ASE パーサーで完全復元し、LAMMPS にキャッシュリプレイ (約 40 秒)。\n     これにより Step 600 時点の位置座標・速度・Nosé-Hoover 熱浴チェイン変数 (η, η_dot) が\n     1 ビットの誤差もなく 100% 完全一致する状態で復元される (`Files are identical` 検証)。\n  2. Step 601 ～ 900: `./tmp/pwscf.save/` に保持された Step 600 の収束済み波動関数 (`wfc1.hdf5`) と\n     電子密度 (`charge-density.hdf5`) を `startingwfc = 'file'`, `startingpot = 'file'` で引き継ぎ、\n     実機 Quantum ESPRESSO (GPU) による SCF 計算へシームレスに移行して追加 300 ステップを実行する。\n・保存先:\n  - ローカル: aimd_2H-SiC_10-10_8periods_bulk_300K_900steps_rtx5080/\n  - NAS (ユーザー特例承認による上書き保存先):\n    \\\\192.168.12.69\\Results\\yamazaki\\research\\第一原理分子動力学法\\{101_0}8周期3.0Å構造最適化なしtest run\\バルクモデル2\n==============================================================================\n\"\"\"\n\nimport os\nimport sys\nimport re\nimport csv\nimport json\nimport time\nimport shutil\nimport datetime\nimport subprocess\nimport numpy as np\n\nos.environ[\"MPLCONFIGDIR\"] = \"/tmp/matplotlib_cache_sic\"\nos.makedirs(\"/tmp/matplotlib_cache_sic\", exist_ok=True)\nimport matplotlib\nmatplotlib.use(\"Agg\")\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport matplotlib.font_manager as fm\nimport matplotlib.ticker as ticker\n\nWORKSPACE_DIR = \"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_workspace_backup\"\nENV_PREFIX = \"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_env_rtx5080\"\nPREV_BULK600_DIR = os.path.join(WORKSPACE_DIR, \"aimd_2H-SiC_10-10_8periods_bulk_300K_600steps_rtx5080\")\nBULK900_AIMD_DIR = os.path.join(WORKSPACE_DIR, \"aimd_2H-SiC_10-10_8periods_bulk_300K_900steps_rtx5080\")\n\nLOG_FILE = os.path.join(WORKSPACE_DIR, \"aimd_8periods_bulk_900steps_run.log\")\n\n\ndef log(msg):\n    now = datetime.datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\")\n    line = f\"[{now}] {msg}\"\n    print(line, flush=True)\n    with open(LOG_FILE, \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(line + \"\\n\")\n\n\ndef sync_to_nas():\n    sync_script = os.path.join(WORKSPACE_DIR, \"sync_bulk_900steps_to_nas_bulk2.py\")\n    if os.path.exists(sync_script):\n        try:\n            subprocess.run([\"python3\", sync_script], cwd=WORKSPACE_DIR, timeout=180, check=False)\n            log(\"Synced current files to NAS (バルクモデル2).\")\n        except Exception as e:\n            log(f\"NAS sync notice: {e}\")\n\n\nQE_ENGINE_CONTINUE_900_CODE = r'''#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\n==============================================================================\nQuantum ESPRESSO + MDI 連成エンジン (Step 0..600 完全キャッシュ復元 & Step 601..900 波動関数・電荷密度引き継ぎ版)\n==============================================================================\n・Step 0 ～ 600 は prev_600steps_espresso_all_steps.pwo から ASE パーサーで完全復元して即座に返却\n・Step 601 以降は ./tmp/pwscf.save 内の Step 600 収束済み波動関数 (wfc1.hdf5) と\n  電荷密度 (charge-density.hdf5) を startingpot='file', startingwfc='file' で引き継いで実機 QE GPU SCF を実行\n\"\"\"\nimport sys\nimport os\nimport re\nimport io\nimport glob\nimport shutil\nimport time\nimport numpy as np\nimport mdi\nfrom ase import Atoms\nfrom ase.calculators.espresso import Espresso, EspressoProfile\nfrom ase.io.espresso import read_espresso_out\nimport ase.parallel\n\n# Rule 3: ASE + MDI の DummyMPI 必須化 (SIGABRT 防止)\nase.parallel.world = ase.parallel.DummyMPI()\n\nELEMENTS = [\n    'H' , 'He', 'Li', 'Be', 'B' , 'C' , 'N' , 'O' , 'F' , 'Ne',\n    'Na', 'Mg', 'Al', 'Si', 'P' , 'S' , 'Cl', 'Ar', 'K' , 'Ca',\n    'Sc', 'Ti', 'V' , 'Cr', 'Mn', 'Fe', 'Co', 'Ni', 'Cu', 'Zn',\n    'Ga', 'Ge', 'As', 'Se', 'Br', 'Kr', 'Rb', 'Sr', 'Y' , 'Zr',\n    'Nb', 'Mo', 'Tc', 'Ru', 'Rh', 'Pd', 'Ag', 'Cd', 'In', 'Sn',\n    'Sb', 'Te', 'I' , 'Xe', 'Cs', 'Ba', 'La', 'Ce', 'Pr', 'Nd',\n    'Pm', 'Sm', 'Eu', 'Gd', 'Tb', 'Dy', 'Ho', 'Er', 'Tm', 'Yb',\n    'Lu', 'Hf', 'Ta', 'W' , 'Re', 'Os', 'Ir', 'Pt', 'Au', 'Hg',\n    'Tl', 'Pb', 'Bi', 'Po', 'At', 'Rn', 'Fr', 'Ra', 'Ac', 'Th',\n    'Pa', 'U' , 'Np', 'Pu', 'Am', 'Cm', 'Bk', 'Cf', 'Es', 'Fm',\n    'Md', 'No', 'Lr', 'Rf', 'Db', 'Sg', 'Bh', 'Hs', 'Mt', 'Ds',\n    'Rg', 'Cn', 'Nh', 'Fl', 'Mc', 'Lv', 'Ts', 'Og',\n]\natomic_number_to_symbol = {i + 1: symbol for i, symbol in enumerate(ELEMENTS)}\ntype_to_symbol = {1: 'C', 2: 'Si'}\n\nexitflag = False\nqm_natoms = 0\nqm_elements = None\nqm_coords = None\nbox = np.zeros(9, dtype=np.float64)\nflag_box = False\n\nqm_pe = 0.0\nqm_forces = None\nlast_evaluated_coords = None\nstep_counter = 0\ncached_steps = {}\n\n\ndef log(msg):\n    print(f\"[QE-MDI Engine] {msg}\", flush=True)\n\n\ndef error(txt):\n    log(f\"ERROR: {txt}\")\n    sys.exit(1)\n\n\ndef load_cached_600_steps():\n    global cached_steps\n    cache_file = \"prev_600steps_espresso_all_steps.pwo\"\n    if not os.path.exists(cache_file):\n        log(\"No previous cache file found; running all steps from scratch.\")\n        return\n    t0 = time.time()\n    with open(cache_file, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"ignore\") as f:\n        text = f.read()\n    chunks = re.split(r\"\\n?=== STEP (\\d+) ===\\n\", text)\n    for i in range(1, len(chunks), 2):\n        st = int(chunks[i])\n        content = chunks[i + 1]\n        atoms_list = list(read_espresso_out(io.StringIO(content), index=slice(None)))\n        atoms_obj = atoms_list[-1]\n        pe_ev = float(atoms_obj.get_potential_energy())\n        forces_ev_ang = np.array(atoms_obj.get_forces(), dtype=np.float64)\n        m_it = re.search(r\"convergence has been achieved in\\s+(\\d+)\\s+iterations\", content)\n        n_it = int(m_it.group(1)) if m_it else 16\n        cached_steps[st] = (pe_ev, forces_ev_ang, n_it, content)\n    log(f\"Loaded {len(cached_steps)} cached steps (Step 0..{max(cached_steps.keys())}) in {time.time()-t0:.2f}s.\")\n\n\ndef configure_environment():\n    os.environ.setdefault(\"CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES\", \"0\")\n    os.environ.setdefault(\"OMPI_MCA_btl_vader_single_copy_mechanism\", \"none\")\n    os.environ.setdefault(\"CUDA_CACHE_MAXSIZE\", \"2147483648\")\n    os.environ.setdefault(\"CUDA_CACHE_DISABLE\", \"0\")\n    os.environ.setdefault(\"NVCOMPILER_ACC_SYNCHRONOUS\", \"0\")\n\n    nvhpc_roots = sorted(glob.glob(\"/opt/nvidia/hpc_sdk/Linux_x86_64/*\"), reverse=True)\n    extra_libs = []\n    if nvhpc_roots:\n        root = nvhpc_roots[0]\n        extra_libs.extend([\n            f\"{root}/compilers/lib\",\n            f\"{root}/math_libs/lib64\",\n            f\"{root}/cuda/lib64\",\n            f\"{root}/comm_libs/mpi/lib\",\n        ])\n        extra_libs.extend(glob.glob(f\"{root}/comm_libs/*/hpcx/*/ompi/lib\"))\n\n    cuda_libs = [\n        \"/usr/local/cuda/lib64\",\n        \"/usr/lib/wsl/lib\",\n        \"/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu\",\n    ]\n    existing_libs = [p for p in (extra_libs + cuda_libs) if os.path.exists(p)]\n    current_ld = os.environ.get(\"LD_LIBRARY_PATH\", \"\")\n    os.environ[\"LD_LIBRARY_PATH\"] = \":\".join(existing_libs + ([current_ld] if current_ld else []))\n\n\ndef detect_pw_command():\n    env_pw = os.environ.get(\"QE_PW_COMMAND\")\n    if env_pw:\n        return env_pw\n\n    pw_bin = \"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_env_rtx5080/bin/pw.x\"\n    mpirun_bin = \"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_env_rtx5080/bin/mpirun\"\n    mpi_np = int(os.environ.get(\"QE_MPI_NP\", \"12\"))\n    omp_threads = os.environ.get(\"QE_OMP_THREADS\", \"2\")\n    os.environ[\"OMP_NUM_THREADS\"] = omp_threads\n    return f\"{mpirun_bin} --oversubscribe -np {mpi_np} {pw_bin} -ndiag 1\"\n\n\ndef load_dft_config():\n    default_config = {\n        'ecutwfc': 40.0,\n        'ecutrho': 320.0,\n        'conv_thr': 1.0e-5,\n        'kpts': None,\n        'occupations': 'smearing',\n        'smearing': 'gaussian',\n        'degauss': 0.01,\n        'mixing_beta': 0.3,\n        'mixing_mode': 'local-TF',\n        'electron_maxstep': 200,\n        'pseudopotentials': {'Si': 'Si.upf', 'C': 'C.upf'},\n    }\n    try:\n        if os.path.exists(\"dft_settings.py\"):\n            import importlib.util\n            spec = importlib.util.spec_from_file_location(\"dft_settings\", \"dft_settings.py\")\n            mod = importlib.util.module_from_spec(spec)\n            spec.loader.exec_module(mod)\n            if hasattr(mod, 'DFT_CONFIG'):\n                default_config.update(mod.DFT_CONFIG)\n    except Exception as e:\n        log(f\"Notice: Using default DFT parameters ({e})\")\n    return default_config\n\n\ndef has_saved_wfc_and_pot():\n    save_dir = os.path.join(\"./tmp\", \"pwscf.save\")\n    if not os.path.isdir(save_dir):\n        return False\n    has_chg = (\n        os.path.exists(os.path.join(save_dir, \"charge-density.hdf5\"))\n        or os.path.exists(os.path.join(save_dir, \"charge-density.dat\"))\n    )\n    has_wfc = (\n        os.path.exists(os.path.join(save_dir, \"wfc1.hdf5\"))\n        or os.path.exists(os.path.join(save_dir, \"wfc1.dat\"))\n    )\n    return has_chg and has_wfc\n\n\ndef allocate_qm():\n    global qm_elements, qm_coords, qm_forces, last_evaluated_coords\n    n = qm_natoms\n    qm_elements = np.empty(n, dtype=np.int32)\n    qm_coords = np.empty((n, 3), dtype=np.float64)\n    qm_forces = np.empty((n, 3), dtype=np.float64)\n    last_evaluated_coords = None\n\n\ndef receive_qm_natoms(mdicomm):\n    global qm_natoms\n    qm_natoms = mdi.MDI_Recv(1, mdi.MDI_INT, mdicomm)\n    log(f\"Received >NATOMS: {qm_natoms}\")\n    allocate_qm()\n\n\ndef receive_box(mdicomm):\n    global flag_box\n    flag_box = True\n    ierr = mdi.MDI_Recv(9, mdi.MDI_DOUBLE, mdicomm, buf=box)\n    if ierr:\n        error(\"MDI: >CELL reception failed\")\n\n\ndef receive_qm_coords(mdicomm):\n    if not qm_natoms:\n        error(\"Cannot receive >COORDS if # atoms = 0\")\n    ierr = mdi.MDI_Recv(3 * qm_natoms, mdi.MDI_DOUBLE, mdicomm, buf=qm_coords)\n    if ierr:\n        error(\"MDI: >COORDS reception failed\")\n\n\ndef receive_qm_elements(mdicomm):\n    if not qm_natoms:\n        error(\"Cannot receive >ELEMENTS if # atoms = 0\")\n    ierr = mdi.MDI_Recv(qm_natoms, mdi.MDI_INT, mdicomm, buf=qm_elements)\n    if ierr:\n        error(\"MDI: >ELEMENTS reception failed\")\n\n\ndef receive_qm_types(mdicomm):\n    if not qm_natoms:\n        error(\"Cannot receive >TYPES if # atoms = 0\")\n    types = np.empty(qm_natoms, dtype=np.int32)\n    ierr = mdi.MDI_Recv(qm_natoms, mdi.MDI_INT, mdicomm, buf=types)\n    if ierr:\n        error(\"MDI: >TYPES reception failed\")\n    for i, t in enumerate(types):\n        sym = type_to_symbol.get(int(t), 'C')\n        qm_elements[i] = ELEMENTS.index(sym) + 1\n\n\ndef evaluate():\n    global qm_pe, qm_forces, last_evaluated_coords, step_counter\n    if qm_natoms == 0 or qm_elements is None or qm_coords is None:\n        error(\"System atoms, elements, or coordinates not fully specified\")\n\n    if last_evaluated_coords is not None and np.allclose(qm_coords, last_evaluated_coords, atol=1e-8):\n        return\n\n    bohr_to_angstrom = mdi.MDI_Conversion_factor(\"bohr\", \"angstrom\")\n    ev_to_hartree = mdi.MDI_Conversion_factor(\"electron_volt\", \"hartree\")\n    force_conv = ev_to_hartree * bohr_to_angstrom\n\n    coords_angstrom = qm_coords * bohr_to_angstrom\n    symbols = [atomic_number_to_symbol[int(anum)] for anum in qm_elements]\n\n    if flag_box and np.linalg.norm(box) > 1e-6:\n        cell_matrix_bohr = box.reshape(3, 3)\n        cell_matrix_angstrom = cell_matrix_bohr * bohr_to_angstrom\n    else:\n        cell_matrix_angstrom = np.eye(3) * 10.0\n\n    z_coords = coords_angstrom[:, 2]\n    Lz = cell_matrix_angstrom[2, 2]\n    z_min, z_max = float(np.min(z_coords)), float(np.max(z_coords))\n    current_gap = (z_min + Lz) - z_max\n\n    # Step 0..600: Exact cache replay to restore positions, velocities, and Nosé-Hoover chain variables\n    if step_counter in cached_steps:\n        pe_ev, forces_ev_angstrom, n_scf_iters, pwo_text = cached_steps[step_counter]\n        with open(\"espresso_all_steps.pwo\", \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f_out:\n            f_out.write(f\"\\n=== STEP {step_counter} ===\\n\")\n            f_out.write(pwo_text)\n        if step_counter == 600:\n            with open(\"espresso.pwo\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f_pwo:\n                f_pwo.write(pwo_text)\n            shutil.copyfile(\"espresso.pwo\", \"live_espresso.pwo\")\n\n        qm_pe = pe_ev * ev_to_hartree\n        qm_forces = forces_ev_angstrom * force_conv\n        fmax = np.max(np.linalg.norm(forces_ev_angstrom, axis=1))\n        log(\n            f\"--- [Step {step_counter}] Done in 0.00s ({n_scf_iters} SCF iters) [RESTORED CACHE] | \"\n            f\"E_pot: {pe_ev:.4f} eV | Fmax: {fmax:.5f} eV/A | gap: {current_gap:.4f} A ---\"\n        )\n        last_evaluated_coords = np.copy(qm_coords)\n        step_counter += 1\n        return\n\n    # Step 601..900: Live Quantum ESPRESSO GPU SCF calculation inheriting wfc1.hdf5 & charge-density.hdf5\n    atoms = Atoms(symbols=symbols, positions=coords_angstrom, cell=cell_matrix_angstrom, pbc=[True, True, True])\n    command_str = detect_pw_command()\n    cfg = load_dft_config()\n\n    reuse_prev_wfc = has_saved_wfc_and_pot()\n\n    electrons_dict = {\n        'conv_thr': cfg['conv_thr'],\n        'mixing_beta': cfg['mixing_beta'],\n        'mixing_mode': cfg['mixing_mode'],\n        'electron_maxstep': cfg['electron_maxstep'],\n    }\n    if reuse_prev_wfc:\n        electrons_dict['startingpot'] = 'file'\n        electrons_dict['startingwfc'] = 'file'\n\n    input_data = {\n        'control': {\n            'calculation': 'scf',\n            'pseudo_dir': './',\n            'outdir': './tmp',\n            'tprnfor': True,\n            'tstress': True,\n            'disk_io': 'medium',\n        },\n        'system': {\n            'ecutwfc': cfg['ecutwfc'],\n            'ecutrho': cfg['ecutrho'],\n            'occupations': cfg['occupations'],\n            'smearing': cfg['smearing'],\n            'degauss': cfg['degauss'],\n        },\n        'electrons': electrons_dict,\n    }\n\n    log(\n        f\"--- [Step {step_counter}] Starting SCF ({len(atoms)} atoms, \"\n        f\"startingpot/wfc={'file' if reuse_prev_wfc else 'atomic'}, \"\n        f\"z_min={z_min:.4f}A, z_max={z_max:.4f}A, gap={current_gap:.4f}A) ---\"\n    )\n\n    t0 = time.time()\n    profile = EspressoProfile(command=command_str, pseudo_dir=\"./\")\n    calc = Espresso(profile=profile, pseudopotentials=cfg['pseudopotentials'], input_data=input_data, kpts=cfg['kpts'])\n    atoms.calc = calc\n\n    pe_ev = atoms.get_potential_energy()\n    forces_ev_angstrom = atoms.get_forces()\n    elapsed = time.time() - t0\n\n    n_scf_iters = -1\n    if os.path.exists(\"espresso.pwo\"):\n        with open(\"espresso.pwo\", \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"ignore\") as f_in:\n            pwo_text = f_in.read()\n        m_it = re.search(r\"convergence has been achieved in\\s+(\\d+)\\s+iterations\", pwo_text)\n        if m_it:\n            n_scf_iters = int(m_it.group(1))\n        with open(\"espresso_all_steps.pwo\", \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f_out:\n            f_out.write(f\"\\n=== STEP {step_counter} ===\\n\")\n            f_out.write(pwo_text)\n        shutil.copyfile(\"espresso.pwo\", \"live_espresso.pwo\")\n\n    qm_pe = pe_ev * ev_to_hartree\n    qm_forces = forces_ev_angstrom * force_conv\n    fmax = np.max(np.linalg.norm(forces_ev_angstrom, axis=1))\n\n    log(\n        f\"--- [Step {step_counter}] Done in {elapsed:.2f}s ({n_scf_iters} SCF iters) | \"\n        f\"E_pot: {pe_ev:.4f} eV | Fmax: {fmax:.5f} eV/A | gap: {current_gap:.4f} A ---\"\n    )\n    last_evaluated_coords = np.copy(qm_coords)\n    step_counter += 1\n\n\ndef execute_command(command, mdicomm, object_ptr):\n    global exitflag\n    if command == \"EXIT\":\n        log(\"Received EXIT command from driver.\")\n        exitflag = True\n    elif command == \">NATOMS\":\n        receive_qm_natoms(mdicomm)\n    elif command == \">CELL\":\n        receive_box(mdicomm)\n    elif command == \">ELEMENTS\":\n        receive_qm_elements(mdicomm)\n    elif command == \">TYPES\":\n        receive_qm_types(mdicomm)\n    elif command == \">COORDS\":\n        receive_qm_coords(mdicomm)\n    elif command in [\"<ENERGY\", \"<PE\"]:\n        evaluate()\n        ierr = mdi.MDI_Send(qm_pe, 1, mdi.MDI_DOUBLE, mdicomm)\n        if ierr:\n            error(\"MDI: <ENERGY send failed\")\n    elif command == \"<FORCES\":\n        evaluate()\n        ierr = mdi.MDI_Send(qm_forces, 3 * qm_natoms, mdi.MDI_DOUBLE, mdicomm)\n        if ierr:\n            error(\"MDI: <FORCES send failed\")\n    else:\n        error(f\"Unrecognized MDI command: {command}\")\n    return 0\n\n\ndef main():\n    configure_environment()\n    load_cached_600_steps()\n    mdi_options = None\n    for i, arg in enumerate(sys.argv):\n        if arg in [\"-mdi\", \"--mdi\"] and i + 1 < len(sys.argv):\n            mdi_options = sys.argv[i + 1]\n            break\n    if not mdi_options:\n        error(\"MDI options not provided.\")\n\n    log(f\"Initializing MDI Engine with options: {mdi_options}\")\n    mdi.MDI_Init(mdi_options)\n    mdi.MDI_Register_Node(\"@DEFAULT\")\n    for cmd in [\"EXIT\", \">NATOMS\", \">CELL\", \">ELEMENTS\", \">TYPES\", \">COORDS\", \"<ENERGY\", \"<PE\", \"<FORCES\"]:\n        mdi.MDI_Register_Command(\"@DEFAULT\", cmd)\n    mdi.MDI_Set_Execute_Command_Func(execute_command, None)\n\n    log(\"Waiting for MDI driver connection...\")\n    mdicomm = mdi.MDI_Accept_Communicator()\n    log(\"Connected to MDI driver! Entering communication loop...\")\n\n    while not exitflag:\n        command = mdi.MDI_Recv_Command(mdicomm)\n        execute_command(command, mdicomm, None)\n\n    log(\"MDI Engine execution terminated cleanly.\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n'''\n\n\ndef prepare_bulk900_aimd():\n    log(\"==============================================================================\")\n    log(\"Preparing Continuation of 300 K NVT AIMD (Step 601..900, total 900 steps = 900 fs)\")\n    log(\"Inheriting 100% of Step 600 state (coords, velocities, Nosé-Hoover bath, wfc, charge density, energy/forces)\")\n    log(\"==============================================================================\")\n\n    os.makedirs(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n\n    # Copy common assets from PREV_BULK600_DIR\n    for asset in [\n        \"C.upf\",\n        \"Si.upf\",\n        \"RELAXATION_GRAPH_PROTOCOL.json\",\n        \"dft_settings.py\",\n        \"make_xyz.py\",\n        \"msmincho.ttc\",\n        \"times.ttf\",\n        \"auto_generate_progression_graphs.py\",\n        \"bulk_10-10_288atoms_true_bulk.data\",\n        \"bulk_10-10_288atoms_true_bulk.cif\",\n        \"bulk_10-10_288atoms_true_bulk.xyz\",\n        \"bulk_10-10_288atoms_aimd_300steps_final.data\",\n        \"bulk_10-10_288atoms_aimd_600steps_final.data\",\n    ]:\n        src = os.path.join(PREV_BULK600_DIR, asset)\n        if os.path.exists(src):\n            dst = os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, asset)\n            shutil.copyfile(src, dst)\n            if asset.endswith(\".py\"):\n                os.chmod(dst, 0o755)\n\n    # Copy Step 0..600 full QE outputs for exact cache replay\n    src_pwo_all = os.path.join(PREV_BULK600_DIR, \"espresso_all_steps.pwo\")\n    dst_pwo_cache = os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, \"prev_600steps_espresso_all_steps.pwo\")\n    shutil.copyfile(src_pwo_all, dst_pwo_cache)\n\n    # Copy Step 600 converged wavefunction (wfc1.hdf5) and charge density (charge-density.hdf5) in ./tmp\n    src_tmp = os.path.join(PREV_BULK600_DIR, \"tmp\")\n    dst_tmp = os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, \"tmp\")\n    if os.path.exists(dst_tmp):\n        shutil.rmtree(dst_tmp)\n    shutil.copytree(src_tmp, dst_tmp)\n    log(\"Copied Step 600 converged wavefunction (wfc1.hdf5) and electron density (charge-density.hdf5) to ./tmp/pwscf.save/\")\n\n    # Write continuation QE-MDI engine\n    engine_path = os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, \"qe_mdi_engine_rtx5080.py\")\n    with open(engine_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(QE_ENGINE_CONTINUE_900_CODE)\n    os.chmod(engine_path, 0o755)\n\n    # Write in.lammps (runs 600 steps via cache replay in ~40s to restore exact bath state, then continues 300 more steps to 900)\n    in_lammps_content = \"\"\"# ==============================================================================\n# 2H-SiC {10-10} 8周期相当 (16層, 288原子) 真のバルクモデル (真空層 0 Å)\n# 300K NVT 第一原理分子動力学: Step 600 からの完全引き継ぎ追加 300 steps (通算 900 steps = 900 fs)\n# ==============================================================================\nunits           metal\ndimension       3\nboundary        p p p\natom_style      atomic\natom_modify     map yes\n\n# 1. 初期構造の読み込み\nread_data       bulk_10-10_288atoms_true_bulk.data\n\n# 原子質量設定 (Rule 2: Type 1: C = 12.011, Type 2: Si = 28.085)\nmass            1 12.011\nmass            2 28.085\n\npair_style      none\n\n# 2. MDI 通信設定 (Quantum ESPRESSO を第一原理 QM エンジンとして連成)\nfix             1 all mdi/qm elements C Si\n\n# 3. 初期熱運動速度の付与 (Maxwell-Boltzmann 分布 @ 300K, 同一乱数シード 87654)\nvelocity        all create 300.0 87654 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian\n\n# 4. 運動方程式の数値積分 & サーモスタット設定 (NVT アンサンブル @ 300K)\ntimestep        0.001\nfix             2 all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1\n\n# 5. 重心ドリフト防止 (50ステップごとに全並進運動量をゼロにリセット)\nfix             3 all momentum 50 linear 1 1 1\n\n# 6. 出力設定 & ログ記録\nthermo_style    custom step temp epair emol ke pe etotal press fmax fnorm\nthermo          1\nthermo_modify   flush yes\n\ndump            1 all custom 1 dump.lammpstrj id type x y z vx vy vz fx fy fz\ndump_modify     1 sort id flush yes\n\n# 7. Step 0..600 をキャッシュリプレイして位置・速度・熱浴内部変数を100%完全復元し、チェックポイントを出力\nrun             600\nwrite_restart   restart.bulk_600steps_restored\nwrite_data      bulk_10-10_288atoms_aimd_600steps_restored_check.data\n\n# 8. Step 601..900 の追加 300 ステップを実機 QE GPU SCF (Step 600 の波動関数・電荷密度引き継ぎ) で連続実行\nrestart         50 restart.bulk_step\nrun             300\n\nwrite_restart   restart.bulk_900steps_final\nwrite_data      bulk_10-10_288atoms_aimd_900steps_final.data\nundump          1\n\"\"\"\n    with open(os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, \"in.lammps\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(in_lammps_content)\n\n    for fn in [\"dump.lammpstrj\", \"log.lammps\", \"lmp.log\", \"qe_engine.log\", \"espresso.pwo\", \"espresso_all_steps.pwo\"]:\n        p = os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, fn)\n        if os.path.exists(p):\n            os.remove(p)\n\n    log(\"Prepared bulk 900-step AIMD continuation directory and input files.\")\n    sync_to_nas()\n\n\ndef run_bulk900_aimd():\n    port = 8049\n    env = os.environ.copy()\n    env[\"PATH\"] = f\"{ENV_PREFIX}/bin:\" + env.get(\"PATH\", \"\")\n    env[\"LD_LIBRARY_PATH\"] = f\"{ENV_PREFIX}/lib:\" + env.get(\"LD_LIBRARY_PATH\", \"\")\n    env[\"OMPI_MCA_btl_vader_single_copy_mechanism\"] = \"none\"\n    env[\"QE_MPI_NP\"] = \"12\"\n    env[\"QE_OMP_THREADS\"] = \"2\"\n\n    lmp_bin = os.path.join(ENV_PREFIX, \"bin\", \"lmp\")\n    py_bin = os.path.join(ENV_PREFIX, \"bin\", \"python3\")\n\n    t0 = time.time()\n    lmp_log_f = open(os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, \"lmp.log\"), \"w\")\n    qe_log_f = open(os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, \"qe_engine.log\"), \"w\")\n\n    log(f\"Launching LAMMPS driver and QE-MDI engine on port {port} (Step 0..600 cache restore -> Step 601..900 live SCF)...\")\n    lmp_proc = subprocess.Popen(\n        [lmp_bin, \"-mdi\", f\"-role DRIVER -name LAMMPS -method TCP -port {port}\", \"-in\", \"in.lammps\", \"-log\", \"log.lammps\"],\n        cwd=BULK900_AIMD_DIR,\n        env=env,\n        stdout=lmp_log_f,\n        stderr=subprocess.STDOUT,\n    )\n    time.sleep(2)\n    qe_proc = subprocess.Popen(\n        [py_bin, \"qe_mdi_engine_rtx5080.py\", \"-mdi\", f\"-role ENGINE -name QE -method TCP -port {port} -hostname localhost\"],\n        cwd=BULK900_AIMD_DIR,\n        env=env,\n        stdout=qe_log_f,\n        stderr=subprocess.STDOUT,\n    )\n\n    last_sync_time = time.time()\n    while lmp_proc.poll() is None:\n        time.sleep(15)\n        if time.time() - last_sync_time >= 300:\n            dump_path = os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, \"dump.lammpstrj\")\n            if os.path.exists(dump_path) and os.path.getsize(dump_path) > 0:\n                subprocess.run([py_bin, \"make_xyz.py\", \"dump.lammpstrj\", \"md_animation.xyz\"], cwd=BULK900_AIMD_DIR, env=env, check=False)\n            sync_to_nas()\n            last_sync_time = time.time()\n\n    try:\n        qe_proc.wait(timeout=30)\n    except subprocess.TimeoutExpired:\n        qe_proc.kill()\n\n    lmp_log_f.close()\n    qe_log_f.close()\n    elapsed = time.time() - t0\n\n    subprocess.run([py_bin, \"make_xyz.py\", \"dump.lammpstrj\", \"md_animation.xyz\"], cwd=BULK900_AIMD_DIR, env=env, check=False)\n    subprocess.run([py_bin, \"make_xyz.py\", \"dump.lammpstrj\", \"md_nvt_animation.xyz\"], cwd=BULK900_AIMD_DIR, env=env, check=False)\n    subprocess.run([py_bin, \"auto_generate_progression_graphs.py\"], cwd=BULK900_AIMD_DIR, env=env, check=False)\n\n    log(f\"Bulk 300 K AIMD Continuation (Step 601..900, total 900 steps) Completed in {elapsed:.1f}s ({elapsed/60.0:.1f} min)!\")\n\n\ndef analyze_and_plot_results():\n    thermo_data = {}\n    with open(os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, \"log.lammps\")) as f:\n        for line in f:\n            parts = line.split()\n            if len(parts) == 10 and parts[0].isdigit():\n                step = int(parts[0])\n                thermo_data[step] = {\n                    \"temp\": float(parts[1]),\n                    \"ke\": float(parts[4]),\n                    \"pe\": float(parts[5]),\n                    \"etotal\": float(parts[6]),\n                    \"press\": float(parts[7]),\n                    \"fmax\": float(parts[8]),\n                    \"fnorm\": float(parts[9]),\n                }\n\n    scf_data = {}\n    with open(os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, \"qe_engine.log\")) as f:\n        for line in f:\n            m = re.search(r\"\\[Step (\\d+)\\] Done in ([\\d\\.]+)s \\((\\d+) SCF iters\\)\", line)\n            if m:\n                scf_data[int(m.group(1))] = (float(m.group(2)), int(m.group(3)))\n\n    with open(os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, \"dump.lammpstrj\")) as f:\n        lines = f.readlines()\n\n    frames_dict = {}\n    i = 0\n    while i < len(lines):\n        if \"ITEM: TIMESTEP\" in lines[i]:\n            step = int(lines[i + 1].strip())\n            natoms = int(lines[i + 3].strip())\n            data = []\n            for l in lines[i + 9 : i + 9 + natoms]:\n                parts = l.split()\n                data.append([\n                    int(parts[0]),\n                    int(parts[1]),\n                    float(parts[2]),\n                    float(parts[3]),\n                    float(parts[4]),\n                    float(parts[5]),\n                    float(parts[6]),\n                    float(parts[7]),\n                ])\n            data.sort(key=lambda x: x[0])\n            frames_dict[step] = np.array(data)\n            i += 9 + natoms\n        else:\n            i += 1\n\n    sorted_steps = sorted(frames_dict.keys())\n    pos0 = frames_dict[0][:, 2:5]\n    Lz = 21.311153136327466\n    Lx = 9.228\n    Ly = 15.144\n    cell_dims = np.array([Lx, Ly, Lz])\n\n    rows = []\n    for step in sorted_steps:\n        arr = frames_dict[step]\n        pos = arr[:, 2:5]\n        dpos = pos - pos0\n        dpos = dpos - cell_dims * np.round(dpos / cell_dims)\n        dr = np.linalg.norm(dpos, axis=1)\n        dz = np.abs(dpos[:, 2])\n\n        th = thermo_data.get(step, {})\n        scf_t, scf_it = scf_data.get(step, (0.0, 0))\n        rows.append({\n            \"step\": step,\n            \"time_fs\": float(step),\n            \"scf_iters\": scf_it,\n            \"scf_time_s\": scf_t,\n            \"temp_K\": th.get(\"temp\", 0.0),\n            \"ke_eV\": th.get(\"ke\", 0.0),\n            \"pe_eV\": th.get(\"pe\", 0.0),\n            \"etotal_eV\": th.get(\"etotal\", 0.0),\n            \"press_bar\": th.get(\"press\", 0.0),\n            \"fmax_eV_A\": th.get(\"fmax\", 0.0),\n            \"fnorm_eV_A\": th.get(\"fnorm\", 0.0),\n            \"dr_max_A\": round(float(np.max(dr)), 5),\n            \"dr_rms_A\": round(float(np.sqrt(np.mean(dr**2))), 5),\n            \"dz_max_A\": round(float(np.max(dz)), 5),\n            \"dz_rms_A\": round(float(np.sqrt(np.mean(dz**2))), 5),\n        })\n\n    csv_path = os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, \"aimd_bulk_900steps_summary.csv\")\n    with open(csv_path, \"w\", newline=\"\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        writer = csv.DictWriter(f, fieldnames=list(rows[0].keys()))\n        writer.writeheader()\n        writer.writerows(rows)\n\n    def calc_window_stats(start_step, end_step=None):\n        sub = [r for r in rows if r[\"step\"] >= start_step and (end_step is None or r[\"step\"] <= end_step)]\n        t_arr = np.array([r[\"temp_K\"] for r in sub])\n        et_arr = np.array([r[\"etotal_eV\"] for r in sub])\n        pe_arr = np.array([r[\"pe_eV\"] for r in sub])\n        ke_arr = np.array([r[\"ke_eV\"] for r in sub])\n        return {\n            \"window\": f\"Step {start_step}..{sub[-1]['step']} ({len(sub)} points)\",\n            \"temp_mean_K\": float(np.mean(t_arr)),\n            \"temp_std_K\": float(np.std(t_arr)),\n            \"etotal_mean_eV\": float(np.mean(et_arr)),\n            \"etotal_std_eV\": float(np.std(et_arr)),\n            \"pe_mean_eV\": float(np.mean(pe_arr)),\n            \"pe_std_eV\": float(np.std(pe_arr)),\n            \"ke_mean_eV\": float(np.mean(ke_arr)),\n            \"ke_std_eV\": float(np.std(ke_arr)),\n        }\n\n    stats = {\n        \"natoms\": 288,\n        \"n_periods\": 8,\n        \"target_temp_K\": 300.0,\n        \"total_steps\": rows[-1][\"step\"],\n        \"bulk_0K_scf_energy_eV\": -127726.1628,\n        \"ensemble_all_0_to_900\": calc_window_stats(0),\n        \"ensemble_phase1_0_to_300\": calc_window_stats(0, 300),\n        \"ensemble_phase2_300_to_600\": calc_window_stats(300, 600),\n        \"ensemble_phase3_600_to_900\": calc_window_stats(600),\n        \"ensemble_equil_400_to_900\": calc_window_stats(400),\n        \"ensemble_equil_500_to_900\": calc_window_stats(500),\n    }\n    with open(os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, \"aimd_bulk_900steps_ensemble_stats.json\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        json.dump(stats, f, indent=4, ensure_ascii=False)\n\n    plt.rcParams[\"mathtext.fontset\"] = \"stix\"\n    mincho_path = os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, \"msmincho.ttc\")\n    times_path = os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, \"times.ttf\")\n    prop_label = fm.FontProperties(fname=mincho_path, size=10.5) if os.path.exists(mincho_path) else fm.FontProperties(size=10.5)\n    prop_tick = fm.FontProperties(fname=times_path, size=9.5) if os.path.exists(times_path) else fm.FontProperties(size=9.5)\n    prop_legend = fm.FontProperties(fname=mincho_path, size=8.5) if os.path.exists(mincho_path) else fm.FontProperties(size=8.5)\n\n    steps = np.array([r[\"step\"] for r in rows])\n    temp = np.array([r[\"temp_K\"] for r in rows])\n    etot = np.array([r[\"etotal_eV\"] for r in rows])\n    pe = np.array([r[\"pe_eV\"] for r in rows])\n    ke = np.array([r[\"ke_eV\"] for r in rows])\n\n    fig_w = 8.0 / 2.54\n    fig_h = 6.2 / 2.54\n    mark_every = 30\n\n    def style_ax(ax, xlabel, ylabel):\n        ax.set_xlabel(xlabel, fontproperties=prop_label, labelpad=4)\n        ax.set_ylabel(ylabel, fontproperties=prop_label, labelpad=4)\n        ax.tick_params(direction=\"in\", top=True, right=True, length=3.5, width=0.8)\n        for sp in ax.spines.values():\n            sp.set_linewidth(0.9)\n        ax.set_xlim(-15, 915)\n        ax.xaxis.set_major_locator(ticker.MultipleLocator(150))\n        ax.yaxis.get_major_formatter().set_useOffset(False)\n        ax.yaxis.get_major_formatter().set_scientific(False)\n        for lbl in ax.get_xticklabels() + ax.get_yticklabels():\n            lbl.set_fontproperties(prop_tick)\n\n    # 1. 全エネルギー推移 (Word 8cm)\n    fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(fig_w, fig_h), dpi=600)\n    ax.plot(steps, etot, color=\"#8A2BE2\", lw=1.1, zorder=2)\n    ax.scatter(steps[::mark_every], etot[::mark_every], marker=\"^\", facecolors=\"none\", edgecolors=\"#8A2BE2\", s=28, linewidths=1.0, zorder=3)\n    style_ax(ax, \"MDステップ [step]\", r\"全エネルギー [$\\mathrm{eV}$]\")\n    e_min, e_max = float(np.min(etot)), float(np.max(etot))\n    span = max(e_max - e_min, 0.2)\n    ax.set_ylim(e_min - 0.35 * span, e_max + 0.35 * span)\n    ax.yaxis.set_major_formatter(ticker.FormatStrFormatter(\"%.2f\"))\n    fig.tight_layout(pad=0.3)\n    for ext in [\"png\", \"pdf\", \"svg\"]:\n        fig.savefig(os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, f\"全エネルギー推移_バルクAIMD_900steps_word_8cm.{ext}\"), dpi=600)\n        fig.savefig(os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, f\"全エネルギー推移_バルクAIMD_600steps_word_8cm.{ext}\"), dpi=600)\n    plt.close(fig)\n\n    # 2. ポテンシャルエネルギー推移 (Word 8cm)\n    fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(fig_w, fig_h), dpi=600)\n    ax.plot(steps, pe, color=\"#8A2BE2\", lw=1.1, zorder=2)\n    ax.scatter(steps[::mark_every], pe[::mark_every], marker=\"^\", facecolors=\"none\", edgecolors=\"#8A2BE2\", s=28, linewidths=1.0, zorder=3)\n    style_ax(ax, \"MDステップ [step]\", r\"ポテンシャルエネルギー [$\\mathrm{eV}$]\")\n    p_min, p_max = float(np.min(pe)), float(np.max(pe))\n    pspan = max(p_max - p_min, 1.0)\n    ax.set_ylim(p_min - 0.15 * pspan, p_max + 0.15 * pspan)\n    ax.yaxis.set_major_formatter(ticker.FormatStrFormatter(\"%.1f\"))\n    fig.tight_layout(pad=0.3)\n    for ext in [\"png\", \"pdf\", \"svg\"]:\n        fig.savefig(os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, f\"ポテンシャルエネルギー推移_バルクAIMD_900steps_word_8cm.{ext}\"), dpi=600)\n        fig.savefig(os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, f\"ポテンシャルエネルギー推移_バルクAIMD_600steps_word_8cm.{ext}\"), dpi=600)\n    plt.close(fig)\n\n    # 3. エネルギー変化量推移 (Word 8cm)\n    d_etot = etot - etot[0]\n    d_pe = pe - pe[0]\n    d_ke = ke - ke[0]\n    fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(fig_w, fig_h), dpi=600)\n    ax.axhline(0.0, color=\"#888888\", ls=\":\", lw=0.8, zorder=1)\n    ax.plot(steps, d_etot, color=\"#8A2BE2\", lw=1.2, label=r\"全エネルギー $\\Delta E_{\\mathrm{tot}}$\", zorder=4)\n    ax.scatter(steps[::mark_every], d_etot[::mark_every], marker=\"^\", facecolors=\"none\", edgecolors=\"#8A2BE2\", s=24, linewidths=0.9, zorder=5)\n    ax.plot(steps, d_pe, color=\"#1E90FF\", lw=1.1, ls=\"--\", label=r\"ポテンシャル $\\Delta E_{\\mathrm{pot}}$\", zorder=3)\n    ax.plot(steps, d_ke, color=\"#D2691E\", lw=1.1, ls=\"-.\", label=r\"運動エネルギー $\\Delta E_{\\mathrm{kin}}$\", zorder=3)\n    style_ax(ax, \"MDステップ [step]\", r\"初期値からのエネルギー変化 [$\\mathrm{eV}$]\")\n    ax.yaxis.set_major_formatter(ticker.FormatStrFormatter(\"%.1f\"))\n    ax.legend(prop=prop_legend, loc=\"best\", frameon=True, framealpha=0.9, edgecolor=\"#CCCCCC\")\n    fig.tight_layout(pad=0.3)\n    for ext in [\"png\", \"pdf\", \"svg\"]:\n        fig.savefig(os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, f\"エネルギー変化量推移_バルクAIMD_900steps_word_8cm.{ext}\"), dpi=600)\n        fig.savefig(os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, f\"エネルギー変化量推移_バルクAIMD_600steps_word_8cm.{ext}\"), dpi=600)\n    plt.close(fig)\n\n    # 4. 温度推移 (Word 8cm)\n    fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(fig_w, fig_h), dpi=600)\n    ax.axhline(300.0, color=\"#222222\", ls=\"--\", lw=1.0, zorder=1)\n    ax.axvline(300.0, color=\"#888888\", ls=\":\", lw=0.8, zorder=1)\n    ax.axvline(600.0, color=\"#888888\", ls=\":\", lw=0.8, zorder=1)\n    ax.plot(steps, temp, color=\"#8A2BE2\", lw=1.1, zorder=2)\n    ax.scatter(steps[::mark_every], temp[::mark_every], marker=\"^\", facecolors=\"none\", edgecolors=\"#8A2BE2\", s=28, linewidths=1.0, zorder=3)\n    style_ax(ax, \"MDステップ [step]\", r\"温度 [$\\mathrm{K}$]\")\n    fig.tight_layout(pad=0.3)\n    for ext in [\"png\", \"pdf\", \"svg\"]:\n        fig.savefig(os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, f\"温度推移_バルクAIMD_900steps_word_8cm.{ext}\"), dpi=600)\n        fig.savefig(os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, f\"温度推移_バルクAIMD_600steps_word_8cm.{ext}\"), dpi=600)\n    plt.close(fig)\n\n    # 5. エネルギー・温度総合推移 (プレゼン仕様)\n    fig, (ax1, ax2, ax3) = plt.subplots(3, 1, figsize=(6.5, 7.2), dpi=300, sharex=True)\n    ax1.plot(steps, temp, color=\"#D2691E\", lw=1.5, label=r\"温度 $T$ (バルク 288原子)\")\n    ax1.axhline(300.0, color=\"#222222\", ls=\"--\", lw=1.0, label=\"目標温度 (300 K)\")\n    ax1.axvline(300.0, color=\"#666666\", ls=\":\", lw=1.0, label=\"引き継ぎ境界 (Step 300 / 600)\")\n    ax1.axvline(600.0, color=\"#666666\", ls=\":\", lw=1.0)\n    ax1.set_ylabel(r\"温度 $T$ [$\\mathrm{K}$]\", fontproperties=prop_label)\n    ax1.grid(True, ls=\":\", alpha=0.5)\n    ax1.tick_params(direction=\"in\", top=True, right=True)\n    ax1.legend(prop=prop_legend, loc=\"lower right\", frameon=True)\n\n    ax2.plot(steps, etot, color=\"#8A2BE2\", lw=1.5, label=r\"全エネルギー $E_{\\mathrm{tot}} = E_{\\mathrm{pot}} + E_{\\mathrm{kin}}$\")\n    ax2.scatter(steps[::mark_every], etot[::mark_every], marker=\"^\", facecolors=\"none\", edgecolors=\"#8A2BE2\", s=28, linewidths=1.0)\n    ax2.axvline(300.0, color=\"#666666\", ls=\":\", lw=1.0)\n    ax2.axvline(600.0, color=\"#666666\", ls=\":\", lw=1.0)\n    ax2.set_ylabel(r\"全エネルギー [$\\mathrm{eV}$]\", fontproperties=prop_label)\n    ax2.yaxis.get_major_formatter().set_useOffset(False)\n    ax2.yaxis.get_major_formatter().set_scientific(False)\n    ax2.yaxis.set_major_formatter(ticker.FormatStrFormatter(\"%.2f\"))\n    ax2.set_ylim(e_min - 0.35 * span, e_max + 0.35 * span)\n    ax2.grid(True, ls=\":\", alpha=0.5)\n    ax2.tick_params(direction=\"in\", top=True, right=True)\n    ax2.legend(prop=prop_legend, loc=\"upper left\", frameon=True)\n\n    ax3.plot(steps, pe, color=\"#1E90FF\", lw=1.5, label=r\"ポテンシャルエネルギー $E_{\\mathrm{pot}}$\")\n    ax3.scatter(steps[::mark_every], pe[::mark_every], marker=\"o\", facecolors=\"none\", edgecolors=\"#1E90FF\", s=24, linewidths=0.9)\n    ax3.axvline(300.0, color=\"#666666\", ls=\":\", lw=1.0)\n    ax3.axvline(600.0, color=\"#666666\", ls=\":\", lw=1.0)\n    ax3.axhline(stats[\"ensemble_phase3_600_to_900\"][\"pe_mean_eV\"], color=\"#2E8B57\", ls=\"--\", lw=1.1,\n                label=f\"Step 600..900 平均 $\\\\langle E_{{\\\\mathrm{{pot}}}}\\\\rangle = {stats['ensemble_phase3_600_to_900']['pe_mean_eV']:.2f}$ eV\")\n    ax3.set_xlabel(r\"時間 / MDステップ [$\\mathrm{fs}$]\", fontproperties=prop_label)\n    ax3.set_ylabel(r\"ポテンシャル [$\\mathrm{eV}$]\", fontproperties=prop_label)\n    ax3.yaxis.get_major_formatter().set_useOffset(False)\n    ax3.yaxis.get_major_formatter().set_scientific(False)\n    ax3.yaxis.set_major_formatter(ticker.FormatStrFormatter(\"%.1f\"))\n    ax3.set_xlim(-15, 915)\n    ax3.grid(True, ls=\":\", alpha=0.5)\n    ax3.tick_params(direction=\"in\", top=True, right=True)\n    ax3.legend(prop=prop_legend, loc=\"lower right\", frameon=True)\n\n    for a in (ax1, ax2, ax3):\n        for lbl in a.get_xticklabels() + a.get_yticklabels():\n            lbl.set_fontproperties(prop_tick)\n\n    fig.tight_layout(pad=0.5)\n    for ext in [\"png\", \"pdf\", \"svg\"]:\n        fig.savefig(os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, f\"エネルギー総合推移_バルクAIMD_900steps_プレゼン仕様.{ext}\"), dpi=300)\n        fig.savefig(os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, f\"AIMD_Bulk_Temperature_and_Energy_900steps.{ext}\"), dpi=300)\n        fig.savefig(os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, f\"エネルギー総合推移_バルクAIMD_600steps_プレゼン仕様.{ext}\"), dpi=300)\n        fig.savefig(os.path.join(BULK900_AIMD_DIR, f\"AIMD_Bulk_Temperature_and_Energy_600steps.{ext}\"), dpi=300)\n    plt.close(fig)\n\n    log(\"Generated summary CSV, ensemble stats JSON, and bulk 900-step AIMD plots.\")\n    sync_to_nas()\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    try:\n        prepare_bulk900_aimd()\n        run_bulk900_aimd()\n        analyze_and_plot_results()\n        log(\"ALL BULK 900-STEP CONTINUATION AIMD TASKS COMPLETED SUCCESSFULLY!\")\n    except Exception as exc:\n        log(f\"FATAL ERROR: {exc}\")\n        raise\n","Ov